Package: spark-store-tui
Version: 0.8.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Xynrin <xynrin@163.com>
Depends: ca-certificates
Recommends: chafa, sudo
Homepage: https://github.com/Xynrin/spark-store-tui
Description: Native terminal UI for Spark Store software management
 Spark Store TUI is a Go terminal interface for browsing official Spark Store
 metadata, searching applications, downloading through official Metalink
 mirrors, and installing or uninstalling local packages.
 .
 Interrupted downloads are recovered on the next start and can be resumed.
